Misho's yes to start 4126, 12 Oct ~10:40 UTC; item 1 „შეზღუდე" (§122 scope):
one deep research run at registration, with a hard stop of 60 searches and
30 pages per person.
- migration 237: registration_research (user_id is the primary key, so a
  user is researched once) with what each run spent; contact_facts gains
  conflict_note (item 2: conflicting sources kept and explained);
- registrationResearch/plan.ts: the searches, the stop, confidence (an
  official source or two independent sites confirm; one ordinary source is
  possible), and a one-value key keeping its strongest value with a note of
  what else was found;
- registrationResearch/extract.ts: one model call turns the searches and
  pages into sourced work facts; nothing when it cannot tell the person
  apart from a namesake. REGISTRATION_EXTRACT_BRIEF is MODEL-FACING (D44);
- registrationResearch.service.ts: queued right after registerUser, a
  ticker takes one user a minute; facts go on the user's own numbers,
  private and unmatchable, as saver 0 with source „research", URL, date and
  confidence; a fact the person removed stays removed; Axel facts win.
REGISTRATION_RESEARCH_ON = false until Misho says yes to the brief: nothing
is queued, searched or spent while it is off.

